{
  "version": 1,
  "courseId": 3873464,
  "courseSlug": "nextjs-react-the-complete-guide",
  "courseTitle": "Next.js & React - The Complete Guide",
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "25145684",
      "title": "Working With Fallback Pages",
      "lectureOrder": 278,
      "videoOrder": 259,
      "sourceHash": "9c728b5be93a53aadd4d6d6acccee11d6e8d4bbf34a586c6c7a46c058f8c1292",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.13,
          "end": 5.7,
          "en": "So what's up with this fallback key here?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 5.7,
          "end": 8.31,
          "en": "The fallback key can help you if you have",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 8.31,
          "end": 13.31,
          "en": "a lot of pages that would need to be pre-generated.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 13.7,
          "end": 16.82,
          "en": "Here I only have three dummy products,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 16.82,
          "end": 18.65,
          "en": "and I'm currently not even fetching",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 18.65,
          "end": 20.32,
          "en": "that data from that file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 20.32,
          "end": 21.82,
          "en": "We'll do that later,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 21.82,
          "end": 24.13,
          "en": "but we only have three products.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 24.13,
          "end": 27.38,
          "en": "Now imagine that you have like an Amazon-like website",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 27.38,
          "end": 30.2,
          "en": "with millions of products.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 30.2,
          "end": 33.3,
          "en": "Of course, pre-generating all those products",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 33.3,
          "end": 35.9,
          "en": "like this might not be optimal,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 35.9,
          "end": 39.15,
          "en": "not just because I hard coded this here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 39.15,
          "end": 41.47,
          "en": "We could fetch this dynamically from this file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 41.47,
          "end": 43.34,
          "en": "so that's not the problem,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 43.34,
          "end": 46.6,
          "en": "but simply because pre-generating all",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 46.6,
          "end": 50.38,
          "en": "those millions of pages might take super long,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 50.38,
          "end": 52.4,
          "en": "and there might be products,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 52.4,
          "end": 57.4,
          "en": "let's say you're not Amazon, which are rarely visited.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 57.45,
          "end": 60.69,
          "en": "If you're building a blog and you have hundreds of articles,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 60.69,
          "end": 64.36,
          "en": "you might have some articles which are basically never read.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 64.36,
          "end": 68.59,
          "en": "So then, pre-generating such rarely visited pages",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 68.59,
          "end": 71.07300000000001,
          "en": "is a waste of time and resources.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 72.05,
          "end": 75.32,
          "en": "That's where fallback becomes important.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 75.32,
          "end": 78.3,
          "en": "Here we can set this to true,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 78.3,
          "end": 80.87,
          "en": "and then for example, we could decide",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 80.87,
          "end": 83.55,
          "en": "to only pre-render some pages.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 83.55,
          "end": 86.19,
          "en": "So let's say we wanna pre-render the page",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 86.19,
          "end": 87.87,
          "en": "with product ID one.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 87.87,
          "end": 91.45,
          "en": "So with P1, because that's a highly frequented page,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 91.45,
          "end": 93.55,
          "en": "it's visited very often,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 93.55,
          "end": 97.33,
          "en": "but we don't wanna pre-generate the other two pages.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 97.33,
          "end": 101.22999999999999,
          "en": "With fallback set to true, that's possible",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 101.22999999999999,
          "end": 104.43,
          "en": "because now if I save this, you will notice",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 104.43,
          "end": 106.52000000000001,
          "en": "that if I go back to the starting page,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 106.52000000000001,
          "end": 108.52000000000001,
          "en": "if I click on product three,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 108.52000000000001,
          "end": 111.35,
          "en": "we still load this page successfully.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 111.35,
          "end": 116.24000000000001,
          "en": "Even though it was not added here to paths.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 116.24000000000001,
          "end": 119.65,
          "en": "And the reason for that is that with fallback true,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 119.65,
          "end": 124.65,
          "en": "we tell NextJS that even pages which are not listed here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 125.68,
          "end": 129.16,
          "en": "So even parameter values for the PID parameter,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 129.16,
          "end": 132.87,
          "en": "which are not listed here, can be valid.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 132.87,
          "end": 136.6,
          "en": "Values that should be loaded when they are visited.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 136.6,
          "end": 138.38,
          "en": "But they're not pre-generated,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 138.38,
          "end": 141.54,
          "en": "instead they're generated just in time",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 141.54,
          "end": 144.71,
          "en": "when a request reaches the server.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 144.71,
          "end": 148.94,
          "en": "And that allows us to pre-generate highly visited pages,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 148.94,
          "end": 153.2,
          "en": "and postpone the generation to less frequented pages",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 153.2,
          "end": 156.54,
          "en": "to the server, so that they are only pre-generated",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 156.54,
          "end": 158.15,
          "en": "when they're needed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 158.15,
          "end": 161.71,
          "en": "So that can be a very useful behavior,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 161.71,
          "end": 163.96,
          "en": "but you'll notice a problem here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 163.96,
          "end": 165.85,
          "en": "If I don't click on a link here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 165.85,
          "end": 169.4,
          "en": "but instead I directly enter this in URL,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 169.4,
          "end": 173.62,
          "en": "and therefore send a new request to this page,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 173.62,
          "end": 175.09,
          "en": "we actually get an error.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 175.09,
          "end": 178.25,
          "en": "Cannot read property title of undefined.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 178.25,
          "end": 181.24,
          "en": "The reason for that, is that this pre-generation,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 181.24,
          "end": 184.47,
          "en": "this dynamic pre-generation, when it's needed,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 184.47,
          "end": 186.303,
          "en": "does not finish instantly.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 187.15,
          "end": 190.49,
          "en": "So therefore instead when using this fallback feature,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 190.49,
          "end": 192.92,
          "en": "you should be prepared to return",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 192.92,
          "end": 195.97,
          "en": "a fallback state in your component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 195.97,
          "end": 199.92000000000002,
          "en": "For example, by simply checking if loaded product",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 199.92000000000002,
          "end": 203.45,
          "en": "is maybe not a thing with if not,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 203.45,
          "end": 206.703,
          "en": "and then returning something like loading here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 207.73,
          "end": 209.43,
          "en": "And if you do this, and you add",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 209.43,
          "end": 211.51,
          "en": "this to your component function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 211.51,
          "end": 213.41,
          "en": "and you save everything,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 213.41,
          "end": 215.03,
          "en": "if you now reload this page,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 215.03,
          "end": 216.85,
          "en": "you'll see loading briefly",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 216.85,
          "end": 220.75,
          "en": "and then NextJS will automatically give you that data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 220.75,
          "end": 222.62,
          "en": "once it's done loading.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 222.62,
          "end": 225.85,
          "en": "So this is a little bit like the standard react solution",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 225.85,
          "end": 229.19,
          "en": "with user fact and set state, except for that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 229.19,
          "end": 230.95,
          "en": "you don't need to do any of that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 230.95,
          "end": 233.03,
          "en": "You just get something through props,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 233.03,
          "end": 235.03,
          "en": "you check if it's there yet,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 235.03,
          "end": 238.68,
          "en": "and if it's not you show that fallback content,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 238.68,
          "end": 242.42,
          "en": "and once it's there NextJS will automatically update",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 242.42,
          "end": 244.27,
          "en": "this component page for you,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 244.27,
          "end": 246.853,
          "en": "and then return the regular content here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 248.83,
          "end": 252.55,
          "en": "So with that you see that now I can also reload this page",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 252.55,
          "end": 255.95,
          "en": "and we still load this successfully eventually,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 255.95,
          "end": 258.92,
          "en": "because of that fallback feature.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 258.92,
          "end": 260.59,
          "en": "An alternative would be",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 260.59,
          "end": 263.66,
          "en": "that you don't set fallback to true or false,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 263.66,
          "end": 267.15,
          "en": "but to a string with a value of blocking.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 267.15,
          "end": 270.1,
          "en": "If you do that, then you don't even need",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 270.1,
          "end": 273.15999999999997,
          "en": "that fallback check here in the component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 273.15999999999997,
          "end": 275.36,
          "en": "and hence we can comment this out,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 275.36,
          "end": 277.93,
          "en": "because then NextJS will actually wait",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 277.93,
          "end": 282.61,
          "en": "for this page to fully be pre-generated on the server",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 282.61,
          "end": 284.44,
          "en": "before it serves that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 284.44,
          "end": 286.40999999999997,
          "en": "So then it will take a little bit longer",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 286.40999999999997,
          "end": 289.52,
          "en": "for the visitor of the page to get a response,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 289.52,
          "end": 293.33,
          "en": "but the response which is sent back will be finished.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 293.33,
          "end": 295.71,
          "en": "So for now reload that still works.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 295.71,
          "end": 297.6,
          "en": "It just takes a bit longer.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 297.6,
          "end": 300.51,
          "en": "And again it's up to you which approach you need",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 300.51,
          "end": 302.1,
          "en": "for your application.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 302.1,
          "end": 305.25,
          "en": "Sometimes it's important to show something quickly,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 305.25,
          "end": 308.01,
          "en": "especially if you know that generating the page",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 308.01,
          "end": 310.77,
          "en": "and fetching the data might take a bit longer.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 310.77,
          "end": 313.22,
          "en": "Sometimes it's worth to wait for it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 313.22,
          "end": 314.8,
          "en": "And you don't want to show",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 314.8,
          "end": 317.42,
          "en": "an incomplete page to your visitors",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 317.42,
          "end": 320.29,
          "en": "in such a case, blocking can be better.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 320.29,
          "end": 325.29,
          "en": "Here you saw both and as you see both is super easy to use.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}
